            The rankings draw on manufacturer figures for airflow, sealed suction, hose diameter, tank capacity and filtration, plus warranty terms, how easy accessories are to buy, and the complaints and praise that come up repeatedly in owner feedback. Each vac was then judged on how well it fits a realistic garage, workshop or basement job. We did not run these machines ourselves, and no manufacturer paid to be included.
